{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOGIN is a game about\u2026 well, logging in.<br>But what if every step of the process was designed purely to troll you?<br>Welcome to the world\u2019s most unnecessarily difficult login screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every form, every field, every button \u2013 nothing is safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why? Because somewhere, deep down, you deserve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ ridiculous login \u201clevels\u201d </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rage moments, and maybe some therapy required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedruns, and leaderboard for masochists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No spoilers</strong> \u2013 discover the suffering for yourself</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are professionals saying?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896370/extras/f13dd27d3d4323084bf5c9cbe11e5dcf.avif?t=1760555835\" width=888 height=642 /></span>\u00a0<i><strong>\u201cThis game brought me more new clients than my entire career.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Dr. Emanuel, Therapist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>1 out of 1 therapists recommend it \u2013 for job security.\u201d</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896370?t=1760555835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896370?t=1760555835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896370/d6a2aeba82b4368aa8c1e5bf6a7fa15e2e053201/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760555835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896370/d6a2aeba82b4368aa8c1e5bf6a7fa15e2e053201/capsule